    <section class="sw-view" id="releases" data-view="releases" aria-labelledby="releases-title"><header class="sw-section-head"><div><p class="sw-eyebrow">The release library</p><h2 id="releases-title">Find your next read.</h2></div><p>Ordered by first sighting. Search saved feature titles and software versions.</p></header><form class="sw-filters" data-release-filters hidden role="search"><label>Version or feature<input id="sw-search" type="search" name="query" placeholder="Search a version or feature\u2026" /></label><label>Country<select id="sw-release-country" data-country>${P(i)}</select></label><label>Explicit FSD mapping<select id="sw-hardware"><option value="all">All mappings / unknown</option><option value="hw3">HW3 mapping reported</option><option value="hw4">HW4 mapping reported</option></select></label><button class="sw-button" type="button" data-clear-filters>Reset</button></form><p class="sw-fine">Hardware filters match a reported FSD pairing, not a model/hardware installation cohort. Read each feature\u2019s conditions in the source notes.</p><div id="sw-library">${I(i)}</div></section>
